👑🧠 Birbal and the King’s Question (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked Birbal, “What is the strongest thing in the world?”

Birbal replied, “It is hunger, Your Majesty.”

Akbar was surprised and said, “How can hunger be the strongest?”

Birbal explained, “Hunger can make even a strong person weak. It can make people do things they would never do otherwise.”

Akbar thought about it and agreed.

💖 Moral:

Hunger is a powerful force that affects everyone.
